    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "60 cm",
     "correct": false
    }
   ],
   "solution": "Magnification m = -2 (real image). m = v/u = -2 ⇒ v = -2u. Lens formula: 1/f = 1/v - 1/u. 1/20 = 1/(-2u) - 1/u = -3/(2u). u = -30 cm. So object distance = 30 cm."
