   "section": "Mathematics",
   "text": "If the function f(x) = x^2 - 4x + 3 is given, what is the value of x for which f(x) is maximum or minimum?",
   "options": [
    {
     "label": "A",
     "text": "0",
     "correct": false
    },
    {
     "label": "B",
     "text": "1",
     "correct": false
